abstract: >-
  Structured JSON and CSV dataset of 2026 residential tiered electricity tariffs
  (Juryo Dento A/B) for Japan's 10 major electric utilities, FY2026 renewable
  energy surcharge (4.18 JPY/kWh), and 30 household appliance power profiles,
  paired with a zero-dependency Node.js ESM calculation engine.
